OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned home secured after
OL,4,Aanti-social behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn abandoned home has been boarded up
OL,7,Fand secured after local residents
OL,8,Fcomplained about anti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said its
OL,11,Fneighbourhood team in Wellingborough
OL,12,Fworked with other organisations to
OL,13,F"address concerns" about the property
OL,14,Fon Burns Road in the town's Queensway
OL,15,FWard area.
OL,17,FThe force thanked members of the
OL,18,Fcommunity for reporting the issue and
OL,19,Fproviding information.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
