OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned home secured after
OL,4,Aanti-social behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the house had been secured to
OL,7,F"prevent further unauthorised access
OL,8,Fand reduce the opportunity for
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour".
